{
  "title": "About Sodoto-signin Plugin",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "51e9000000000001",
      "text": "The SODOTO Sign-in plugin puts a Sign in with your SODOTO key button on a portfolio page. It lets the person the portfolio belongs to edit their own site, by proving they hold the key that names them. The private key never leaves their device."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "51e9000000000002",
      "text": "*Marc Pierson and Claude Opus 5.5 · October 2026*",
      "attribution": true
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "51e9000000000003",
      "text": "HOW IT WORKS. Clicking the button asks the wiki for a one-time challenge, signs it in the browser with the person's did:key, and sends back only the signature. The wiki's DID security module checks the signature, and opens an edit session if the key belongs to the owner of this portfolio."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "51e9000000000004",
      "text": "WHAT IT SAYS. Signed in: you can edit this page. Signed in, but this portfolio is not yours to edit: the key is real but names someone else. No SODOTO key on this device: restore or onboard first."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "51e9000000000005",
      "text": "RESTORE ON THIS SITE. A browser keeps what it stores separately for each web address, so a key made on the SODOTO tools site is not visible on the wiki. When no key is found here, the button offers Restore: choose your encrypted recovery file and type its passphrase. The file is unlocked in this browser and nothing is uploaded. The key is then kept here and sign-in carries on."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "51e9000000000006",
      "text": "BROWSERS. Signing uses Ed25519 in the browser, which needs Chrome or Edge 137, Safari 17 or Firefox 129, or later. An older browser is told so plainly, with how to update it, rather than given a cryptic error."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "51e9000000000007",
      "text": "ITEM FORMAT. Each new portfolio site gets one of these at the top when it is created. To add one by hand:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "51e9000000000008",
      "text": "{\n  \"type\": \"sodoto-signin\",\n  \"id\": \"0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"text\": \"Sign in with your SODOTO key\"\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "51e9000000000009",
      "text": "See also [[About SODOTO Badge Plugin]], for the badges this sign-in lets a person keep on their own portfolio."
    }
  ],
